WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:05.339
In the last couple of weeks, you probably
heard me use the term management by optics,

00:00:05.339 --> 00:00:10.639
and I've used this term to refer to the handling
of coronavirus by Donald Trump in the administration,

00:00:10.639 --> 00:00:17.050
and I've also applied it to Mike Pence and
Donald Trump's non use of masks during recent

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:18.470
public appearances.

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:21.360
And there's now a new report from the Associated
Press.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:28.040
Excellent article, which says that indeed,
according to people close to Trump, not authorized

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:30.060
to speak about this.

00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:35.460
Trump is refusing to wear a mask in public
because no one he believes he would look ridiculous

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:37.630
wearing one and number two.

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:39.410
And this is the more interesting piece.

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:44.310
He believes it'll hurt his chances at being
reelected because of the message that wearing

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:45.900
a mask would send.

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:47.460
And we'll get to that report in a second.

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:51.250
So one example of management by optics is
the case.

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:54.251
Numbers in the death numbers are a disaster.

00:00:54.251 --> 00:00:59.790
We've been in these sort of rolling patchworks
of stay at home orders now for close to two

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:00.790
months.

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:01.790
And the numbers are terrible.

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:06.219
Every day we're finding around 25000 new cases
of coronavirus despite testing not having

00:01:06.219 --> 00:01:11.700
increased that dramatically or much at all
over the last half month or so.

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:17.380
We had it spikes once again this week to twenty
five hundred deaths on multiple days during

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:18.380
the week.

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:26.389
So the way that Trump is managing by optics
is simply not talking about deaths and cases.

00:01:26.389 --> 00:01:29.729
Manage the optics, which are say that we won.

00:01:29.729 --> 00:01:35.779
Talk about these heroic warriors, which are
the Americans Trump is talking about.

00:01:35.779 --> 00:01:41.210
Talk about how we are now getting to reopen
the economy in 30 states or whatever the number

00:01:41.210 --> 00:01:45.189
they claim is are starting to reopen their
state economies.

00:01:45.189 --> 00:01:51.689
Mike Pence didn't wear a mask when he went
to the Mayo Clinic recently and he was excoriated

00:01:51.689 --> 00:01:55.259
for it, ended up wearing a mask on his next
visit out.

00:01:55.259 --> 00:01:59.829
But again, it's the optics of if you say things
are going really well, if you say we're past

00:01:59.829 --> 00:02:00.829
the peak.

00:02:00.829 --> 00:02:04.999
If you say we've won, if you say we are now
in the recovery mode, you certainly can't

00:02:04.999 --> 00:02:07.599
be seen wearing a mask for the first time
in public.

00:02:07.599 --> 00:02:11.620
That would imply things are not as good as
you claim they are.

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:13.489
So that gets us to Donald Trump earlier this
week.

00:02:13.489 --> 00:02:15.300
Donald Trump flew out to Arizona.

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:18.100
We covered it, covered some of his live events
there.

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:25.379
He went literally to a mask factory, a factory
repurposed facility of Honeywell, where they

00:02:25.379 --> 00:02:30.790
are making masks and they have in, you know,
right on the wall on a TV.

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:34.400
It is mandatory masks keep a mask on at all
times.

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:35.420
Trump didn't wear a mask.

00:02:35.420 --> 00:02:39.330
And one is once again, we knew we suspected,
based on what we know about Trump, that this

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:41.459
is more management by optics.

00:02:41.459 --> 00:02:45.739
Trump wearing a mask when he says, we've basically
won.

00:02:45.739 --> 00:02:46.739
We're past it.

00:02:46.739 --> 00:02:47.739
We're reopening.

00:02:47.739 --> 00:02:48.739
It's all great.

00:02:48.739 --> 00:02:52.219
He succeeded at keeping the death toll well
below 2 million.

00:02:52.219 --> 00:02:53.810
It doesn't send the right signal.

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:56.290
And indeed, that's exactly what the new report
says.

00:02:56.290 --> 00:03:00.959
Trump believes that if he was seen wearing
a mask, it would hurt his chances of reelection.

00:03:00.959 --> 00:03:03.239
It would make him look ridiculous.

00:03:03.239 --> 00:03:07.620
Trump has had two advisers that wearing a
mask would, quote, send the wrong message

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:11.030
and it would make him seem preoccupied with
health.

00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:13.189
I for me, it would be good.

00:03:13.189 --> 00:03:16.520
I would love to see Trump preoccupied with
health.

00:03:16.520 --> 00:03:17.520
That's the problem.

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:19.549
The problem is he seems not to care about
health.

00:03:19.549 --> 00:03:23.871
Trump also has told confidants, according
to the same Associated Press report, that

00:03:23.871 --> 00:03:29.480
he fears he would look ridiculous in a mask
and that the image of him wearing a mask would

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:33.310
be used in negative ads against him.

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:35.439
Understand the insanity of that.

00:03:35.439 --> 00:03:41.290
The mask has become a proxy political statement
at this point in time.

00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:43.940
If you wear a mask, it means you believe this
is serious.

00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:45.549
You believe things are bad.

00:03:45.549 --> 00:03:48.000
You believe people should be scared.

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:54.130
Not wearing a mask means you don't trust these
hoaxer governors or everything's fine, or

00:03:54.130 --> 00:04:01.049
the economy will soon be open and people will
soon or have already stopped dying from Corona

00:04:01.049 --> 00:04:02.049
virus.

00:04:02.049 --> 00:04:06.939
It's now a political statement, something
that is just supposed to be a matter of science.

00:04:06.939 --> 00:04:09.110
Just to be supposed be a matter of health.

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:14.549
The masks are worn for very empirical, demonstrable
reasons.

00:04:14.549 --> 00:04:19.330
Now they have become political calculations,
and I hate to tell you.

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:24.360
Maybe Trump is making the right calculation
for his followers.

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:30.640
Seeing Trump wear a mask to somebody like
me would say Trump understands the science.

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:32.760
Trump trusts the experts.

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:34.950
Trump cares about other people.

00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:40.160
But Trump is the guy who looked directly at
a solar eclipse and he's making the equivalent

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:41.820
choice here with the masks.

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:45.440
Now, I have to tell you the looking ridiculous
thing.

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:49.280
This is not a show that focuses on things
like the physical appearance of our elected

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:53.490
officials, but Trump saying the mask will
make me look ridiculous.

00:04:53.490 --> 00:04:57.640
Trump has been going around with a lunatic
looking fake tan for years.

00:04:57.640 --> 00:05:01.290
He walks around in these oversized suits very
often.

00:05:01.290 --> 00:05:05.470
Even if we grant the concern about looking
ridiculous with the mask and how that might

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:09.790
affect his supporters or whatever, Trump regularly
looks ridiculous.

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:13.110
And so that is also sort of a complicated
thing to get a sense of.

00:05:13.110 --> 00:05:15.260
But it's not the most important thing.

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:23.260
The most important thing here is the continued
management by optics and the really sad reality

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:26.170
that when it comes to his followers, he may
be right.

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:30.930
His followers may see him wearing a mask and
actually be turned off by it.

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:36.340
And unfortunately, when Trump's followers
see him not wearing a mask, it encourages

00:05:36.340 --> 00:05:42.100
them not to wear one, which leads to viral
spread, which leads to cases which leads to

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:43.100
deaths.

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:45.280
It's very, very ugly.

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:47.520
Management by optics, extraordinarily dangerous.

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:49.630
And we're seeing that in action.

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:51.880
Look at the case numbers in these states.

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:53.770
Look at what's happening in Texas.

00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:55.050
Look at what's happening in Georgia.

00:05:55.050 --> 00:05:57.790
Arizona states that are reopening early.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:00.070
It's not good and it's getting worse.

00:06:00.070 --> 00:06:02.190
And now Donald Trump is proactively set.

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:36.500
Now, I'm not going to be seen with a mask
that'll be used

00:06:36.500 --> 00:07:28.480
in ads.

